  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Numbers",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 4,
    "summary": "When the camps of Israel move, Aaron and his sons cover the holy things in the tabernacle—The Levites of the families of Kohath, Gershon, and Merari carry the burden of the tabernacle.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And the Lord spake unto Moses and unto Aaron, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 4:1",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 4,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Take the sum of the sons of Kohath from among the sons of Levi, after their families, by the house of their fathers,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 4:2",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 4,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "From thirty years old and upward even until fifty years old, all that enter into the host, to do the work in the tabernacle of the congregation.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 11,
            "text": "1 Chr. 23:3; Luke 3:23."
          },
          {
            "start": 109,
            "end": 112,
            "text": "HEB the tent of meeting (also as found in vv. 4–47)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "1 Chr. 23:3; Luke 3:23.",
            "prettyString": "1 Chronicles 23:3; Luke 3:23",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
